hint: Line 3 has no closing bracket. Python finds that while it reads the file, before running anything.
right: A SyntaxError is found while Python reads the file, before anything runs. Line 3 is missing its `)`, so `'(' was never closed`, and lines 1 and 2 never got the chance to print.
wrong: Line 3 is missing its closing bracket. That's a SyntaxError, and Python finds SyntaxErrors while reading the whole file, before running any line. So the program never starts, and even the correct lines 1 and 2 print nothing.

